  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Kenya Agribusiness Investment conference</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Agriculture Sector Network (ASNET) is organizing the 6th National Agribusiness Summit alongside the 3rd Dairytech and Foodtec event on 9th to 11th September 2026. The event will provide a high-level multi-stakeholder platform for public - private dialogue, knowledge exchange, technology showcasing, business networking, and collaboration aimed at addressing key policy, regulatory, investment, inclusivity, innovation, food processing, and dairy industry issues affecting the sector. The summit and expo will bring together policymakers, agribusiness leaders, processors, dairy industry players development partners, researchers, investors, technology providers, and farmer representatives to collectively identify solutions that can unlock the full potential of Kenya&apos;s agribusiness ecosystem.</narrative>
  </description>
